sequenceDiagram
    actor F as Faculty / HOD
    participant R as CircularsRouter
    participant U as UploadCircularUseCase
    participant W as Celery worker
    participant P as ProcessCircularUseCase
    participant O as OcrEngine
    participant X as CircularExtractor
    actor H as HOD
    participant C as ConfirmCircularUseCase
    F->>R: POST /api/circulars/upload (photo / PDF)
    R->>U: execute(file)
    U-->>R: Circular [UPLOADED]
    R->>W: process_circular_upload(id)
    R-->>F: 202 Accepted
    W->>P: execute(id)
    P->>P: start_processing() [PROCESSING]
    alt PDF has a text layer
        P->>P: read text directly
    else photo or scan
        P->>P: grey scale, denoise, threshold, deskew
        P->>O: extract text (PSM 6, then PSM 4)
        O-->>P: words and confidences
    end
    P->>X: extract date, time, venue, attendees
    X-->>P: fields and field confidences
    P->>P: review gate and duplicate check
    P-->>W: [NEEDS_REVIEW]
    H->>R: GET /api/circulars/review-queue
    R-->>H: circulars with extracted fields
    H->>R: POST /api/circulars/{id}/confirm (corrected fields)
    R->>C: execute(id, fields)
    C->>C: create MEETING event, plan reminders
    C->>C: confirm() [CONFIRMED], commit
    R-->>H: 200 OK (meeting created)
